        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>龙飞行路线与素材信息表</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #111;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    width: 1080px;\n    min-height: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding-top: 25px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .notes {\n    height: 78px;\n    padding: 10px 3px 5px;\n    background: #f3dede;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 18px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  table {\n    width: 1080px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 16px;\n  }\n\n  th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #5b5b5b;\n    padding: 2px 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n  }\n\n  thead th {\n    height: 21px;\n    padding: 1px 2px;\n    background: #d9ead3;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 14px;\n  }\n\n  tbody tr.dragon-row {\n    height: 98px;\n  }\n\n  tbody tr.white-row {\n    height: 98px;\n  }\n\n  .dragon-fire,\n  .dragon-ice {\n    background: #dceff3;\n  }\n\n  .dragon-thunder {\n    background: #e5f3f5;\n  }\n\n  .dragon-white {\n    background: #f4f4f4;\n  }\n\n  .route-note {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 5px 7px;\n  }\n\n  .requirements {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .materials {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-left: 6px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .nowrap {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"notes\">\n    1. 四条龙会在固定路线上不断循环移动，不会在特定时间出现固定位置，篝火或旅馆跳过时间位置不变。<br>\n    2. 现实1分钟，游戏内一小时<br>\n    3. 火龙、雷龙、冰龙飞行路线一段地下、一段地上，白龙飞行全程空中飞行。\n  </div>\n\n  <table aria-label=\"龙飞行路线与素材信息\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width:89px\">\n      <col style=\"width:140px\">\n      <col style=\"width:140px\">\n      <col style=\"width:106px\">\n      <col style=\"width:96px\">\n      <col style=\"width:104px\">\n      <col style=\"width:148px\">\n      <col style=\"width:126px\">\n      <col style=\"width:131px\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th></th>\n        <th>出现地点</th>\n        <th>进入地下地点</th>\n        <th>一圈总飞行时间</th>\n        <th>地上飞行时间</th>\n        <th>地下飞行时间</th>\n        <th>装备需求</th>\n        <th>素材刷新时间</th>\n        <th>素材</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"dragon-row\">\n        <td class=\"dragon-fire\">火龙奥尔龙</td>\n        <td>东阿卡莱平原深穴</td>\n        <td>沃尔纳高地的深穴</td>\n        <td>大约48分钟<br>（现实时间）</td>\n        <td>大约24分钟</td>\n        <td>大约24分钟</td>\n        <td class=\"requirements\">【耐热防护Lv2】<br>可以使用耐火套装<br>[illegible]</td>\n        <td>10分钟<br>（现实时间）</td>\n        <td class=\"materials\">奥尔龙的鳞片<br>奥尔龙的牙齿碎片<br>奥尔龙的爪子<br>奥尔龙的角<br>奥尔龙的龙岩石</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr class=\"dragon-row\">\n        <td class=\"dragon-thunder\">雷龙费罗龙</td>\n        <td>东格鲁德的深穴</td>\n        <td>包尔美高地深穴</td>\n        <td>大约28分钟<br>（现实时间）</td>\n        <td>大约13分钟</td>\n        <td>大约15分钟</td>\n        <td class=\"requirements\">注意更换掉导电武器<br>装备</td>\n        <td>10分钟<br>（现实时间）</td>\n        <td class=\"materials\">费罗龙的鳞片<br>费罗龙的牙齿碎片<br>费罗龙的爪子<br>费罗龙的角<br>费罗龙的龙岩石</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr class=\"dragon-row\">\n        <td class=\"dragon-ice\">冰龙聂尔龙</td>\n        <td>聂尔龙雪原的深穴</td>\n        <td>东部高台的深穴</td>\n        <td>大约34分钟<br>（现实时间）</td>\n        <td>大约12分钟</td>\n        <td>大约22分钟</td>\n        <td class=\"requirements\">【耐寒防护Lv2】<br>可以使用耐寒套装<br>[illegible]</td>\n        <td>1